    "name": "Mobile Payments",
    "description": "# Mobile Payments API\n\nList mobile CSR payments and post/unpost a `payment_multiple_method` row.\n\nBoth endpoints **always use the mobile clinic DB** (`branch_id = 1`). Other `branch_id` values are ignored.\n\n## Auth\n- Header: `API-KEY` (required)\n- Query/body: `token`, `requester` (required on all endpoints)\n\n## Schema (mobile DB only)\nApply `sql/payment_multiple_method_mobile_status.sql` on `mytemr_diagnostic_mobile`:\n- `payment.mobile_van_id` (skip ALTER if the column already exists)\n- `payment_multiple_method.status` enum `posted` | `unposted` (default `unposted`)\n- `payment_multiple_method.posted_by`, `posted_on`\n\n## Status workflow\n- Default: `unposted`\n- `POST /billings/change_status_mobile_payment_method`\n  - `posted`: sets `status`, `posted_by` = requester, `posted_on` = now\n  - `unposted`: sets `status` back to `unposted` and clears `posted_by` / `posted_on`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost/cpci-business-ops-api"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "clinicaRiKOYqlwdTJ-lNedqS0k-it!395!-6ls1JXM7Vcc"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "{{token}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "requester",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "payment_multiple_method_id",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get mobile payments",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "API-KEY",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/billings/get_mobile_payment?token={{token}}&requester={{requester}}&branch_id=1&page=1&data_size=10",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "billings",
            "get_mobile_payment"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "token",
